{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/concepts/generators","title":"Generators and yield*","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"generators-and-yield","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Generators and "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":" is the one mechanism the whole library rests on. This page explains what"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"it actually does, then covers "},{"t":"code","text":"craftGen"},{"t":"text","text":", which lets you write a tracked"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"generator outside a service."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"why-a-generator-at-all","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Why a generator at all"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Dependencies hidden in a runtime container are invisible from the outside:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nothing in the consumer's type says they exist. The compiler can't catch a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"missing provider, and a test can't tell you what to mock."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A generator gives the runtime a channel. Each "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":" reports \"I need this\","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the driver resolves it, and the dependency is recorded "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"in the type"}]},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"TaskList"},{"text":" } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftService","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  { name: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'TaskList'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", providedIn: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'function'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"api"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"TaskApi","kind":"function"},{"text":"(); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// tracked","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tasks"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"state","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'tasks'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", []); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// tracked","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Everything downstream reads that type: the route DI check, the testing register,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the dependency snapshot."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-rule","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The rule"}]},{"t":"quote","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every named entity yields what it does not own. A factory, a "},{"t":"code","text":"craftComputed"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a "},{"t":"code","text":"craftMethod"},{"t":"text","text":", a generator insertion member — each one records "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"its"}]},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"dependencies with "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Owning means: the primitive internals handed to "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"this"}]},{"t":"text","text":" insertion"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"("},{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"set"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"update"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"patch"},{"t":"text","text":"). Everything else — another primitive, a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"service, a sibling method, an input, a nested resource reader — is yielded."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"counter"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"state","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'counter'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"0","kind":"number"},{"text":", ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"state"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"update"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"increment","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"update","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"value"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" value "},{"text":"+","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"1","kind":"number"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  doubled: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"craftUse","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"craftComputed","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'doubled'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"state","kind":"function"},{"text":"()) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  })),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}));","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"stats"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftUse","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"craftComputed","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'stats'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"counter","kind":"function"},{"text":"()) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"+","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" counter.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"doubled","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}));","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"increment"},{"t":"text","text":" may return "},{"t":"code","text":"update(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" directly: it is not a generator, and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"insertion wrapper consumes the write. "},{"t":"code","text":"doubled"},{"t":"text","text":" does not own "},{"t":"code","text":"state()"},{"t":"text","text":", so it"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"yields it. "},{"t":"code","text":"stats"},{"t":"text","text":" does not own "},{"t":"code","text":"counter"},{"t":"text","text":", so it yields both readers."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"In a Craft template, pass the reader or the method instead of wrapping a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"synchronous call:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(counter);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ click: counter.increment }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'+'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftUse(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" is the synchronous boundary: when there is no generator to yield"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"from, a field or callback can drive the primitive with it instead. That is the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"end of the graph, which is why "},{"t":"code","text":"craftUse"},{"t":"text","text":" has nothing to track. Use it in tests"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and other synchronous boundaries too:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"craftUse(counter.increment())"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Yield only what you use: "},{"t":"code","text":"yield* TaskApi.fetchAll()"},{"t":"text","text":" records one property"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"instead of the whole service, which is what keeps test registers small. See"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/app/expose-api","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Shaping the public API"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts/require-yieldable-reactive-read"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts/require-yieldable-insertion-write"},{"t":"text","text":" and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts/require-yieldable-template-method"},{"t":"text","text":" ESLint rules enforce this. See"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/routing/eslint-rules","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"ESLint rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"craftgen-—-a-tracked-generator-outside-a-service","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftGen"},{"t":"text","text":" — a tracked generator outside a service"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Build reusable generator factories that can be composed with "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":" and that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"short-circuit through typed "},{"t":"code","text":"craftException"},{"t":"text","text":" values."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftGen(factory)"},{"t":"text","text":" wraps a generator factory and returns an invoker you delegate"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"to with "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":". It keeps the inner generator model intact:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"dependency yields still flow to the outer driver;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the success value is returned through "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftException(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" results are converted into a "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftGenShortCircuit"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the reachable exception codes remain visible at the type level."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"That makes it the right tool for reusable route logic — role checks, feature"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"flags, onboarding gates."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"the-common-case","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The common case"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftException, craftGen } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"